      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَاوِىُّ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَائِىٌّ</span>, in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثوأ</span>. You say <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَافِيَةٌ ثَاوِيَّةٌ</span>
